SUMMARY:Where Does It Come From?
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special screening of Where Does It Come From?\, an engaging animated film that takes visitors on a fascinating journey to discover how oil is found and extracted from deep beneath the Earth&rsquo\;s surface. Through simple storytelling and animation\, visitors will explore the science behind oil discovery\, drilling and production\, while gaining a deeper understanding of the role of energy in our daily lives.
